twork with opportunities relevant to your career goals.\",\"tnV2TabIntroductionTitle\":\"Join the Insight Partners Talent Network\",\"tnV2TabIntroductionText\":\"Get first access to new opportunities with the leading software ScaleUps.\",\"tnV2SuccessMessageTitle\":\"Welcome to the Insight Partners Talent Network!\",\"tnV2SuccessMessageText\":\"As a member, you'll have access to:\\n\\n- **8K+ open roles at 500+ Insight-backed companies** \u2013 apply, hear from interested companies \\u0026 sign up for job alerts (sent via our Job Board, Getro)\\n- **Exclusive networking events** to connect with peers \\u0026 top industry leaders\\n- **Investor POVs \\u0026 growth frameworks** to fuel your career growth\\n\\nLooking forward to staying in touch!\",\"tnTabIntroductionText\":\"As our companies grow, they look to us to help them find the best talent.\\r\\n\\r\\nSignal that you'd be interested in working with a Insight Venture Partners company to help us put the right opportunities at great companies on your radar. The choice to pursue a new career move is then up to you.\",\"tnSignUpWelcomeText\":\"#### Welcome!\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you for joining Insight Venture Partners Network!\\r\\n\\r\\nTo help us best support you in your search, please take a few minutes to tell us about what you are looking for in your next role. We\u2019ll use this information to connect you to relevant opportunities in the Insight Venture Partners network as they come up.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can always update this information later.\",\"tnHidden\":false,\"tnS"
